{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# AbilitySystem｜流程图\n只呈现能力从装配、申请到结束的阶段；类和接口见 [[GGYGO_结构_AbilitySystem.canvas|结构图]]、[[AbilitySystem/结构|结构文档]]。组仲裁 [[GGYGO_流程_能力仲裁.canvas|子图]] · 伤害 [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|子图]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1650,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "grant",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. 状态宿主创建 ASC 与基础属性，并按 AbilitySet 授予 GA / GE。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "request",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. 玩家 InputTag 或 Boss ActionTag 形成激活申请。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "check",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. ASC 检查 Tag、消耗、组规则和优先级。\n详见 [[GGYGO_流程_能力仲裁.canvas|仲裁子图]]。",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "active",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. GA 激活：Montage、事件窗口、移动请求与相机接管按能力配置执行。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 195,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "fail",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "拒绝：反馈原因；仅可重试的玩家意图进入缓冲。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. GA 完成/取消：释放组、撤销相机接管；可能唤醒缓冲请求。",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "damage",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "命中分支：GE → 属性 → Cue；详见 [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|伤害子图]]。",
      "x": 1430,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "grant",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "request",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "能力已授予"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "request",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "check",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "申请激活"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "check",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "active",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "条件通过"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "check",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "fail",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "阻断/消耗不足"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "active",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "end",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "结束或打断"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "active",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "damage",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "命中时"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7",
      "fromNode": "end",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "request",
      "toSide": "bottom",
      "label": "释放后重试"
    }
  ]
}
